<Base title="About · aninir lab">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Nir Peretz, a developer and artist. I spent years building games for the web. This is
      my lab: a place for experiments in 3D, shaders, interactive pieces and small games.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every project here is a standalone piece with its own tools and dependencies, so a 2019
      three.js sketch and a new WebGPU study can live side by side. The 2014 portfolio is kept as it
      was, in the <a href="/lab/archive/">archive</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose {
    max-width: 640px;
    padding: 24px 0;
  }
  h1 {
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }
</style>
